<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Depreciation expense for the
six months ended June&#160;30, 2023 and 2024 amounted to RMB <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pp0p0_c20230101__20230630_zNlntgiL3Td7"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-06-30" id="Fact001164" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="RMB">336,741</ix:nonFraction>
</span>and RMB <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pp0p0_c20240101__20240630_zWqo8oBvefy8"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-06-30" id="Fact001165" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="RMB">434,622</ix:nonFraction>
</span>(USD <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pp0p0_uUSD_c20240101__20240630_zUoOaefuYhs8"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-06-30" id="Fact001166" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">61,170</ix:nonFraction></span>),
respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>



